#: includes/abilities/divi.php:27
msgid "Check Divi setup"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/divi.php:28
msgid "Reports whether Divi 5 is active on this site (and its version), and — given a post_id — whether that post is built with Divi 5, legacy Divi 4, or something else, plus whether its module tree is structurally valid. Read-only. Call this before editing any page on a Divi site: Divi 4 pages and non-Divi pages must not be edited with divi-* tools."
